WEBVTT

00:01:32.970 --> 00:01:36.670
<i>El Amdart Ler Ares.</i>

00:01:38.710 --> 00:01:41.340
<i>Di Flatam Dalas!</i>

00:02:04.530 --> 00:02:07.290
<i>You've gotten a lot better, Haruhi.</i>

00:02:08.000 --> 00:02:09.450
<i>It's getting cold.</i>

00:02:09.450 --> 00:02:10.610
<i>Let's go home.</i>

00:02:10.610 --> 00:02:11.750
OK.

00:02:11.750 --> 00:02:14.470
Ibuki-sama, please think this through again.

00:02:15.670 --> 00:02:17.330
It's too late to stop now.

00:02:17.330 --> 00:02:20.430
I have to keep my promise to Natsune-neesama.

00:02:20.430 --> 00:02:21.630
But, Ibuki-sama...

00:02:21.630 --> 00:02:22.550
Quiet!

00:02:22.550 --> 00:02:23.750
Kamijou-san?

00:02:29.130 --> 00:02:33.650
A girl I'd never seen before was with Kamijou-san.

00:02:33.650 --> 00:02:39.740
I got an uneasy feeling when I heard their voices arguing.

00:02:39.970 --> 00:02:46.740
<b>A Mysterious Transfer Student</b>

00:02:49.600 --> 00:02:51.200
I'll have the five-grain curry!

00:02:51.200 --> 00:02:53.010
I'll have that too, too!

00:02:53.010 --> 00:02:54.780
What should I have...?

00:02:54.780 --> 00:02:56.130
That's rare.

00:02:56.130 --> 00:02:57.830
You don't have a boxed lunch today?

00:02:57.830 --> 00:03:03.430
Well, Sumomo had to go somewhere with her friend today so she didn't make me one.

00:03:03.430 --> 00:03:05.010
A friend, huh?

00:03:05.010 --> 00:03:08.400
Maybe she found somebody more important than you, huh?

00:03:10.300 --> 00:03:12.250
S-Somebody more important?!

00:03:12.750 --> 00:03:14.120
Brother!

00:03:16.590 --> 00:03:17.660
Speak of the devil...

00:03:17.660 --> 00:03:18.560
Sumomo-chan!

00:03:19.080 --> 00:03:22.490
Good timing.  There's someone I want you all to meet.

00:03:22.490 --> 00:03:23.600
What?!

00:03:23.600 --> 00:03:26.520
No way!  She really has a boyfriend?

00:03:26.520 --> 00:03:28.230
Come on, come on.

00:03:28.230 --> 00:03:29.350
Hey!  Let me go!

00:03:29.350 --> 00:03:31.410
Let me go I said.

00:03:34.890 --> 00:03:36.150
That girl...

00:03:40.330 --> 00:03:42.010
I'll introduce you.

00:03:42.010 --> 00:03:45.690
This is a girl who transfered into my class, Ibuki-chan.

00:03:45.690 --> 00:03:47.700
Hi, Ibuki-chan.

00:03:47.700 --> 00:03:52.180
D-Don't put "chan" at the end of my name.  That's far too informal.

00:03:52.180 --> 00:03:54.290
Oh, she's embarrassed!

00:03:54.290 --> 00:03:55.560
That's so cute!

00:03:55.560 --> 00:03:57.040
Hey, stop it I said.

00:03:57.040 --> 00:03:57.880
Greetings.

00:03:58.320 --> 00:04:02.420
I'm the nicest guy at Mizuhosaka Academy, Takamizo Hachisuke!

00:04:02.420 --> 00:04:04.050
Call me Hachi!

00:04:04.050 --> 00:04:05.530
<i>Deh Tagnar!</i>

00:04:09.340 --> 00:04:10.370
How impudent!

00:04:10.370 --> 00:04:11.500
Don't try to touch me like that.

00:04:12.740 --> 00:04:14.200
What was that magic?

00:04:15.260 --> 00:04:24.850
Uhm, Ibuki-san is in the School of Magic, but she just transfered here so I decided to show her around.

00:04:24.850 --> 00:04:27.820
What's with this difference in treatment?

00:04:28.240 --> 00:04:32.500
Ibuki-san, did you know Kamijou Saya-chan before you came here?

00:04:33.070 --> 00:04:33.990
Saya?

00:04:33.990 --> 00:04:37.180
I saw you two talking by the lake last night.

00:04:38.180 --> 00:04:39.660
That's got nothing to do with you!

00:04:40.360 --> 00:04:41.320
Ibuki-chan?

00:04:41.320 --> 00:04:42.870
Sorry!  See you later.

00:04:43.310 --> 00:04:44.610
Ibuki-chan!

00:04:46.370 --> 00:04:47.830
Hey now!

00:04:47.830 --> 00:04:49.410
They left.

00:04:49.410 --> 00:04:51.320
What's with her?

00:04:55.320 --> 00:05:00.000
I guess you've been baptized by her already.

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:01.690
Baptized?

00:05:01.690 --> 00:05:03.230
What do you mean?

00:05:03.910 --> 00:05:10.760
You've heard of Shikimori family, right?  One of the most powerful mage families in the world?

00:05:10.760 --> 00:05:12.440
<i>The</i> Shikimori family?

00:05:12.440 --> 00:05:13.230
That one?

00:05:13.230 --> 00:05:16.970
Yes, Ibuki-san is the heir of that family.

00:05:16.970 --> 00:05:20.230
You could say that she's a thoroughbred mage.

00:05:20.230 --> 00:05:21.720
I knew it.

00:05:21.720 --> 00:05:26.670
So that's why she was able to cast attack magic without chanting.  I figured she was someone special.

00:05:26.670 --> 00:05:33.520
It would really help me if you'd try to get her acclimated to the school as soon as possible.

00:05:33.520 --> 00:05:35.470
Of course!

00:05:42.960 --> 00:05:44.210
I smell something.

00:05:44.210 --> 00:05:44.900
What?

00:05:44.900 --> 00:05:46.370
Shikimori Ibuki!

00:05:46.890 --> 00:05:50.540
Why would the heir to the Shikimori family come to our school?

00:05:50.540 --> 00:05:52.830
There's gotta be something more to it.

00:05:53.260 --> 00:05:55.030
Something more?

00:05:55.380 --> 00:05:59.040
Like she couldn't put up with the Shikimori family's rules and ran away.

00:05:59.040 --> 00:06:02.080
Or she was banished for falling in love with a commoner!

00:06:02.080 --> 00:06:04.160
Anri-chan, you're imagining things.

00:06:04.160 --> 00:06:07.260
We won't know until we investigate!

00:06:07.260 --> 00:06:09.780
Wait, Anri-chan!

00:06:18.760 --> 00:06:19.860
Kamijou-san?

00:06:19.860 --> 00:06:23.320
Please have nothing more to do with Ibuki-sama.

00:06:24.450 --> 00:06:25.290
What do you mean?

00:06:25.730 --> 00:06:29.940
Ibuki-sama is fated to leave this school soon.

00:06:29.940 --> 00:06:31.040
What-?

00:06:31.040 --> 00:06:32.470
Wait.

00:06:32.470 --> 00:06:34.890
Why do you know about her?

00:06:36.850 --> 00:06:39.740
What is she to you?

00:06:39.740 --> 00:06:40.830
Well...

00:06:40.830 --> 00:06:42.620
Let me explain that.

00:06:45.010 --> 00:06:46.220
Brother...

00:06:46.790 --> 00:06:48.420
Kamijou-kun...

00:06:51.020 --> 00:06:56.120
We of the Kamijou family have served the Shikimori family for generations.

00:06:56.120 --> 00:07:00.050
To us, Ibuki-sama is our master.

00:07:00.050 --> 00:07:04.060
If there are any more unnecessary inquiries, I will show no mercy.

00:07:04.060 --> 00:07:05.500
Please understand that.

00:07:05.870 --> 00:07:07.690
Kamijou-kun!

00:07:08.030 --> 00:07:11.650
Brother, I have no intention of fighting them...

00:07:11.650 --> 00:07:13.230
Of course not.

00:07:13.230 --> 00:07:17.710
But if we don't put it this strongly we may end up getting them involved.

00:07:17.710 --> 00:07:23.190
If the worst happens, then we of the Kamijou family should be the only victims.

00:07:23.890 --> 00:07:25.380
Yes, Brother.

00:07:32.760 --> 00:07:33.720
What?

00:07:33.720 --> 00:07:34.970
She just went home?

00:07:34.970 --> 00:07:39.150
I am no longer in the mood.  I have no intention of going to classes today.

00:07:39.150 --> 00:07:41.920
I had a terrible time making excuses to the teacher.

00:07:41.920 --> 00:07:44.620
What a peculiar girl.

00:07:44.620 --> 00:07:49.820
Ibuki-chan's personality is like that, and she isn't fitting in very well with the class.

00:07:49.820 --> 00:07:51.590
So I'm worried.

00:07:51.590 --> 00:07:53.520
You're being awful nice.

00:07:53.520 --> 00:07:54.420
Well...

00:07:54.420 --> 00:07:56.890
She's part of our school.

00:07:56.890 --> 00:08:00.860
Don't you want her to have a lot of fun memories?

00:08:00.860 --> 00:08:07.330
Your mom wants you to make more of these delicious croquettes filled with your love and care.

00:08:07.330 --> 00:08:09.870
Jeez, Mom...

00:08:09.870 --> 00:08:10.910
Why not?

00:08:10.910 --> 00:08:11.910
Good luck.

00:08:11.910 --> 00:08:13.510
I'm behind you all the way.

00:08:14.580 --> 00:08:15.500
Right!

00:08:16.290 --> 00:08:19.330
A way to get close to Ibuki-chan?

00:08:20.670 --> 00:08:23.060
Sumomo insists...

00:08:23.060 --> 00:08:24.840
Give me some advice.

00:08:24.840 --> 00:08:26.750
Please!

00:08:28.270 --> 00:08:29.630
Yes, yes!

00:08:29.630 --> 00:08:31.590
You, too, Kamisaka-san.

00:08:31.830 --> 00:08:33.470
U-Uhm...

00:08:33.470 --> 00:08:35.140
OK, I'll help you!

00:08:35.140 --> 00:08:36.530
Anri-san!

00:08:37.030 --> 00:08:39.800
Did you forget what Kamijou-kun said to us yesterday?

00:08:39.800 --> 00:08:41.990
Who's scared of a threat like that?

00:08:41.990 --> 00:08:43.510
It'll be fine!

00:08:43.510 --> 00:08:46.240
Leave it to me!

00:08:46.470 --> 00:08:47.470
Plan 1

00:08:46.470 --> 00:08:47.470
E-Mail plan

00:08:46.470 --> 00:08:47.470
by Anri

00:08:47.760 --> 00:08:50.620
First we start by getting her e-mail address.

00:08:51.040 --> 00:08:53.470
Why her e-mail?

00:08:53.470 --> 00:08:55.350
You don't get it.

00:08:56.550 --> 00:09:00.580
Communication by e-mail is the way into a girl's heart!

00:09:00.580 --> 00:09:03.520
It's a standard technique!

00:09:03.520 --> 00:09:05.520
Go, Sumomo!

00:09:05.520 --> 00:09:08.950
Ibuki-chan, would you tell me your address?

00:09:08.950 --> 00:09:11.490
What, are you having a dance party or something?

00:09:12.530 --> 00:09:14.980
An e-mail address, not a dress...

00:09:16.130 --> 00:09:18.720
I have no cell phone!

00:09:18.800 --> 00:09:19.840
Plan 1

00:09:18.800 --> 00:09:19.840
E-Mail plan

00:09:18.800 --> 00:09:19.840
by Anri

00:09:19.850 --> 00:09:21.010
<b>Failure</b>

00:09:21.210 --> 00:09:22.210
Plan 2

00:09:21.210 --> 00:09:22.210
Diary Exchange plan

00:09:21.210 --> 00:09:22.210
by Jun

00:09:23.650 --> 00:09:25.470
Diary exchange?

00:09:25.470 --> 00:09:27.900
Isn't that a bit out of fashion?

00:09:27.900 --> 00:09:30.100
What are you talking about?

00:09:30.100 --> 00:09:35.360
This is perfect for an old-fashioned girl who doesn't even own a cellphone.

00:09:35.360 --> 00:09:36.610
Go, Sumomo!

00:09:36.610 --> 00:09:37.340
Right.

00:09:37.720 --> 00:09:40.920
Ibuki-chan, would you exchange diaries with me?

00:09:40.920 --> 00:09:42.120
Exchange diaries?

00:09:42.120 --> 00:09:46.580
You write down something that happened during the day, no matter how small it is.

00:09:47.660 --> 00:09:49.520
What do you want to know?

00:09:50.820 --> 00:09:54.040
I'm asking what do you want to know about me!

00:09:54.040 --> 00:09:59.670
I'm not such a low-class girl that I will sell the secrets of the Shikimori family to an outsider!

00:09:59.670 --> 00:10:01.290
That's not what I meant!

00:10:01.510 --> 00:10:02.380
Plan 2

00:10:01.510 --> 00:10:02.380
Diary Exchange plan

00:10:01.510 --> 00:10:02.380
by Jun

00:10:02.400 --> 00:10:03.550
<b>Failure</b>

00:10:03.710 --> 00:10:04.010
Plan 3

00:10:03.710 --> 00:10:04.010
Exchange Favorite Objects plan

00:10:03.710 --> 00:10:04.010
by Anri

00:10:04.030 --> 00:10:04.780
<b>Failure</b>

00:10:04.950 --> 00:10:05.200
Plan 4

00:10:04.950 --> 00:10:05.200
"I was the one who broke the vase!" plan

00:10:04.950 --> 00:10:05.200
by Hachisuke

00:10:05.200 --> 00:10:05.600
<b>Failure</b>

00:10:05.650 --> 00:10:05.870
Plan 5

00:10:05.650 --> 00:10:05.870
Outright Begging plan

00:10:05.650 --> 00:10:05.870
By Jun

00:10:05.870 --> 00:10:06.100
<b>Failure</b>

00:10:06.120 --> 00:10:06.170
Plan 6

00:10:06.120 --> 00:10:06.170
Share Your Secrets plan

00:10:06.120 --> 00:10:06.170
by Haruhi

00:10:06.170 --> 00:10:06.430
<b>Failure</b>

00:10:06.430 --> 00:10:06.570
Plan 7

00:10:06.430 --> 00:10:06.570
"My boyfriend is left-handed!" plan

00:10:06.430 --> 00:10:06.570
by Yuuma

00:10:06.570 --> 00:10:06.770
<b>Failure</b>

00:10:06.770 --> 00:10:06.880
Plan 8

00:10:06.770 --> 00:10:06.880
Cat-cat plan

00:10:06.770 --> 00:10:06.880
by Anri

00:10:06.880 --> 00:10:07.100
<b>Failure</b>

00:10:07.100 --> 00:10:07.220
Plan 9

00:10:07.100 --> 00:10:07.220
"The mysteries of the school!" plan

00:10:07.100 --> 00:10:07.220
by Jun

00:10:07.220 --> 00:10:11.690
<b>Failure</b>

00:10:08.730 --> 00:10:12.080
I didn't think she was that defensive...

00:10:12.080 --> 00:10:14.540
All right, then there's only one plan left.

00:10:14.540 --> 00:10:16.120
One plan left?

00:10:16.120 --> 00:10:20.570
Ibuki-chan is attacked by punks on the way home from school.

00:10:20.570 --> 00:10:24.060
Then Sumomo-chan rushes to her rescue and saves the day!

00:10:24.060 --> 00:10:27.550
Ibuki-chan is overwhelmed with gratitude and the two are best friends forever!

00:10:27.550 --> 00:10:28.700
I call it...

00:10:28.470 --> 00:10:31.940
Plan 10

00:10:28.470 --> 00:10:31.940
"Beat back the punks!  The prince on a white horse!" plan

00:10:28.470 --> 00:10:31.940
by Hachisuke

00:10:28.700 --> 00:10:30.180
"Beat back the punks!"

00:10:30.180 --> 00:10:31.950
"The prince on a white horse" plan!

00:10:42.840 --> 00:10:45.360
Why do we have to be the punks?

00:10:45.360 --> 00:10:46.930
It's for Sumomo-chan.

00:10:46.930 --> 00:10:49.360
You should do anything to help her out.

00:10:49.360 --> 00:10:50.860
Are you OK, Sumomo-chan?

00:10:50.860 --> 00:10:52.890
Y-Yes, I'll do my best!

00:10:54.620 --> 00:10:55.910
There she is.

00:10:56.250 --> 00:10:58.990
OK, just as we planned!

00:11:12.490 --> 00:11:15.060
Hey, watch where you're walking!

00:11:15.060 --> 00:11:17.820
His yummy ice cream spilled!

00:11:19.050 --> 00:11:20.480
Pay us for it!

00:11:20.480 --> 00:11:22.830
It was you who wasn't looking.

00:11:22.830 --> 00:11:24.100
What?

00:11:24.100 --> 00:11:26.670
You're in the way.  Get lost.

00:11:26.670 --> 00:11:29.520
You've sure got guts, sweetie.

00:11:29.880 --> 00:11:31.760
What should I do?

00:11:31.760 --> 00:11:33.350
We have to go help her.

00:11:33.350 --> 00:11:34.740
Dressed like this?

00:11:34.740 --> 00:11:36.300
Scum.

00:11:36.300 --> 00:11:39.190
I guess you need a bit of punishment.

00:11:39.190 --> 00:11:40.630
Punishment, she says.

00:11:40.630 --> 00:11:43.240
Sounds fun!  I'm into that stuff.

00:11:45.270 --> 00:11:46.140
Bisaim!

00:11:46.140 --> 00:11:47.200
<i>Yes, Ibuki-sama.</i>

00:11:49.440 --> 00:11:50.610
Take this.

00:11:50.610 --> 00:11:52.170
<i>Deh Tagnar</i>

00:12:04.270 --> 00:12:05.300
Fools.

00:12:10.690 --> 00:12:14.310
Yeah, come to think of it, she was a mage...

00:12:14.310 --> 00:12:17.490
If we'd gone with your plan, we'd have been...

00:12:19.070 --> 00:12:21.090
Hachi!

00:12:21.090 --> 00:12:24.050
No!

00:12:39.370 --> 00:12:42.970
How can I get to be friends with Ibuki-chan?

00:12:43.620 --> 00:12:45.210
Hold a moment.

00:12:45.800 --> 00:12:47.400
Koyuki-san...

00:12:48.350 --> 00:12:49.550
I see.

00:12:50.060 --> 00:12:54.370
You want to be friends with that transfer student.

00:12:54.370 --> 00:12:55.520
Yes.

00:12:55.520 --> 00:12:57.880
She's like a cat.

00:12:57.880 --> 00:12:59.030
A cat?

00:12:59.030 --> 00:13:03.370
When she's out about the town she has her fur up,

00:13:03.370 --> 00:13:07.320
but there's a sadness in her eyes that I just can't ignore...

00:13:07.320 --> 00:13:09.340
Isn't that weird?

00:13:09.340 --> 00:13:10.830
No.

00:13:10.830 --> 00:13:14.770
It's proof that you're seeing her true nature.

00:13:16.190 --> 00:13:18.490
Uhm, my fortune-telling...

00:13:18.490 --> 00:13:20.540
You don't need it.

00:13:20.980 --> 00:13:25.480
If you truly care about them,
your friends open their hearts to you.

00:13:27.760 --> 00:13:29.430
Truly care about them...

00:13:32.290 --> 00:13:39.130
Your mom wants you to make more of these delicious croquettes filled with your love and care.

00:13:47.730 --> 00:13:50.200
Thank you, Koyuki-san.

00:13:50.200 --> 00:13:52.370
I'll try my best.

00:13:53.200 --> 00:13:57.400
I pray for good luck for you, Sumomo-san.

00:13:57.410 --> 00:14:01.190
And happiness for you, Ibuki-san.

00:14:16.690 --> 00:14:17.560
Morning.

00:14:17.560 --> 00:14:19.350
Morning, Brother.

00:14:23.250 --> 00:14:24.620
There's one more than usual.

00:14:24.620 --> 00:14:27.320
That's for Ibuki-chan!

00:14:29.540 --> 00:14:31.570
See you!

00:14:37.560 --> 00:14:39.400
Here you are!

00:14:40.320 --> 00:14:41.650
What is this?

00:14:41.650 --> 00:14:44.840
Sumomo's special croquette boxed lunch!

00:14:44.840 --> 00:14:46.870
Would you like to have lunch with me?

00:14:48.280 --> 00:14:49.070
No.

00:14:50.500 --> 00:14:53.460
Don't you like croquettes?

00:14:53.460 --> 00:14:55.460
That's not the problem.

00:14:55.460 --> 00:14:58.540
I have no intention of eating lunch with you.

00:14:59.330 --> 00:15:00.800
Ibuki-chan...

00:15:18.640 --> 00:15:21.490
Here, try Sumomo's special Salisbury steak boxed lunch!

00:15:23.250 --> 00:15:24.070
No.

00:16:43.650 --> 00:16:45.990
Uhm, may I have a word?

00:16:50.600 --> 00:16:53.980
Why do you make her a boxed lunch every day?

00:16:53.980 --> 00:16:57.220
Ibuki-sama does not accept the charity of others.

00:16:57.220 --> 00:16:59.330
That's not what I'm trying to do.

00:16:59.330 --> 00:17:02.810
I just want to be friends with her.

00:17:03.320 --> 00:17:04.740
Friends?

00:17:05.150 --> 00:17:05.970
Yes.

00:17:05.970 --> 00:17:11.550
She's part of our class, so I want to talk with her, go places with her, take pictures.

00:17:11.860 --> 00:17:14.540
To do things like that.

00:17:29.720 --> 00:17:30.550
Then...

00:17:35.490 --> 00:17:39.140
Ibuki-sama loves omelets.

00:17:39.560 --> 00:17:44.370
She'll enjoy any kind of omelet greatly no matter how it tastes.

00:17:44.370 --> 00:17:50.810
If there was an omelet in the lunch you made for her, she may try it.

00:18:09.030 --> 00:18:09.670
OK!

00:18:12.690 --> 00:18:13.830
Ibuki-chan!

00:18:14.860 --> 00:18:15.810
No.

00:18:15.810 --> 00:18:17.870
I haven't said anything yet.

00:18:17.870 --> 00:18:21.030
Today I've got Sumomo's special rolled omelet boxed lunch!

00:18:22.550 --> 00:18:24.610
You like omelets, don't you?

00:18:25.740 --> 00:18:27.070
Who told you?!

00:18:27.450 --> 00:18:29.080
A friend.

00:18:29.080 --> 00:18:30.760
Would you like to have lunch with me?

00:18:30.760 --> 00:18:33.190
I said no!

00:18:47.870 --> 00:18:49.790
This is your fault!

00:18:49.790 --> 00:18:52.870
You tried to force your boxed lunch on me!

00:18:54.500 --> 00:18:57.580
I have no intention of wasting time with you.

00:18:57.580 --> 00:18:59.710
Stay away from me!

00:19:05.510 --> 00:19:08.370
What is this awful feeling?

00:19:08.370 --> 00:19:13.500
Why do I have to be so disturbed by a girl without magic powers?

00:19:14.150 --> 00:19:18.470
It's because you've been touched by her kindness.

00:19:18.470 --> 00:19:22.200
Was it you who told her what I like?

00:19:22.200 --> 00:19:23.500
I'm sorry.

00:19:24.000 --> 00:19:25.460
You shouldn't have done that.

00:19:26.020 --> 00:19:27.960
I don't care if you scold me.

00:19:27.960 --> 00:19:33.540
Just, please understand her feelings when she tries to get close to you.

00:19:48.180 --> 00:19:49.450
Very well.

00:19:49.450 --> 00:19:51.910
I shall meet with Sumomo Kohinata.

00:19:51.910 --> 00:19:53.730
Ibuki-sama!

00:19:57.140 --> 00:19:58.900
This is awful.

00:19:58.900 --> 00:20:02.790
She said, "I have no intention of wasting time with you. Stay away from me!"

00:20:02.790 --> 00:20:05.720
She just knocked your lunch out of your hands and didn't even apologize...

00:20:05.720 --> 00:20:06.920
That's unforgivable!

00:20:06.920 --> 00:20:08.810
What a waste.

00:20:08.810 --> 00:20:10.590
Want me to eat it?

00:20:10.590 --> 00:20:14.380
But I made it for Ibuki-chan...

00:20:14.380 --> 00:20:15.940
Kohinata Sumomo!

00:20:16.630 --> 00:20:17.770
I've been looking for you.

00:20:17.770 --> 00:20:19.680
I didn't think you'd be in a place like this.

00:20:20.710 --> 00:20:22.070
Ibuki-chan?

00:20:22.070 --> 00:20:23.610
Give me that.

00:20:23.610 --> 00:20:25.210
Just give it to me!

00:20:26.690 --> 00:20:28.230
Put it there.

00:20:29.350 --> 00:20:31.710
What are you going to do, Shikimori-san?

00:20:31.710 --> 00:20:32.900
Could it be...

00:20:32.900 --> 00:20:38.980
<i>Al Kedorna Kabiya Re Relens Furla La Laim!</i>

00:20:40.390 --> 00:20:42.430
Regeneration magic?

00:20:46.890 --> 00:20:50.880
This magic is nothing with the strength of the Shikimori...

00:20:51.380 --> 00:20:54.740
Sis, why don't you use magic?

00:20:54.740 --> 00:20:57.320
You could do it in an instant with magic.

00:20:57.320 --> 00:21:01.400
It tastes better when you make it with love and care.

00:21:01.400 --> 00:21:02.760
Love and care?

00:21:02.760 --> 00:21:05.280
Love and care are the best spices.

00:21:05.280 --> 00:21:09.880
Magic is convenient, but it can't express your feelings.

00:21:17.080 --> 00:21:20.960
This wouldn't be accepting her feelings.

00:21:20.960 --> 00:21:23.420
That's right, isn't it, Sister?

00:21:32.690 --> 00:21:33.630
It's good!

00:21:34.130 --> 00:21:35.340
Ibuki-chan!

00:21:35.720 --> 00:21:39.270
I understand your feelings.

00:21:40.870 --> 00:21:45.150
If you make me a lunch tomorrow, I just might eat it.

00:21:45.150 --> 00:21:46.990
Isn't that great, Sumomo-chan?

00:21:46.990 --> 00:21:47.680
Yes!

00:21:48.870 --> 00:21:51.620
What do you want in your lunch?

00:21:51.620 --> 00:21:52.600
Croquettes?

00:21:52.600 --> 00:21:54.020
Omelet?

00:21:54.020 --> 00:21:56.340
Hey, don't grab me!

00:21:57.720 --> 00:22:03.160
After that, Shikimori-san started eating lunch with Sumomo-chan.

00:22:03.160 --> 00:22:07.640
Here you are, Sumomo's special love-filled croquette boxed lunch!

00:22:07.640 --> 00:22:10.660
Ibuki-chan, eat up!

00:22:10.660 --> 00:22:12.310
Stop calling me "chan".

00:22:12.310 --> 00:22:14.220
Why?

00:22:14.220 --> 00:22:15.090
Because!

00:22:15.090 --> 00:22:16.170
Open up!

00:22:16.170 --> 00:22:19.550
Stop it!  I didn't say you could do that!

00:23:55.080 --> 00:24:25.040
<b>Next Episode</b>

00:23:55.550 --> 00:23:57.280
This is Kamisaka Haruhi.

00:23:57.280 --> 00:24:01.250
I got a book with preview comments written in it from Sumomo-chan earlier.

00:24:01.250 --> 00:24:03.950
I'd like to read from it today.

00:24:03.950 --> 00:24:07.590
The anime of the century that shocked America!

00:24:07.590 --> 00:24:08.730
America?

00:24:08.730 --> 00:24:11.200
I wonder if this anime is going to be broadcast in America?

00:24:11.200 --> 00:24:14.200
A true story that made the whole world cry!

00:24:14.200 --> 00:24:15.270
The whole world?

00:24:15.270 --> 00:24:16.300
A true story?

00:24:16.300 --> 00:24:19.110
Anyway, the next episode is:

00:24:19.110 --> 00:24:21.050
"The Befriend Ibuki Plan."

00:24:19.400 --> 00:24:25.040
<b>The Befriend Ibuki Plan</b>

00:24:21.050 --> 00:24:25.030
I want to be friends with the whole world!
